# Proto area

When working under `packages/compass-proto/` (or composing proto UI in docs), follow [packages/compass-proto/AGENTS.md](../../packages/compass-proto/AGENTS.md). Desktop `IconButton`s wrap with `WithTooltip`; do not add hover or portals to published `IconButton` / `Tooltip`.
